    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trigger + run context\n\nManual run, or a POST webhook on stock-intel/backfill carrying {tickers:[...]} so adding a ticker in the app backfills just that symbol. One SQL opens a run row and returns the active watchlist; Build context (2y) narrows to the webhook list when there is one and sets a two-year window, days_back=600.",
        "width": 912,
