        "content": "## Stock Intel: Backfill\n\nManual, run once after seeding the watchlist or after adding tickers. Pulls two years of daily bars for every active ticker (Alpaca, ~505 bars each, paginated) and computes indicators for all of them (days_back=600). Safe to re-run: every write is an upsert. Takes a few minutes.",
